{
  "about": "The query guard's security matrix (data ADR 561, core ADR 1014): every reach outside the imported tables is refused, ordinary queries over them are admitted and run. Fixture tables people(name, role) and orders(name, qty). `why` is a substring of the refusal's message. Replayed by the bundle's guard (data-bundle/src/query/sql.ts: test/query-guard.spec.ts, test/store-browser.spec.ts, src/__tests__/query-lane.test.ts) and the engine's (paged-data-store/src/guard.rs: tests/guard.rs).",
